    {
      "title": "Two configured fans and four generic slots",
      "description": "All 32 factory records at 3B000..3EE00 encode two fan targets. Loader publishes header low three bits; decoder zeros unused targets. Generic FE also contains two extra peripheral slots; their presence is not evidence of additional physical fans.",
